OL,3,GNEWSAHidden manuscripts reveal medieval
OL,4,Areading habits
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Tamara Atkin, a book historian
OL,7,Ffrom the University of Oxford, said the
OL,8,Fdiscovery "transforms what we can now
OL,9,Fsay about Guernsey's medieval
OL,10,Fmanuscript culture".
